      "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIf <MATH_0001> are fibred in groupoids and\nrepresentable by algebraic spaces <MATH_0002> over <MATH_0003>, then we have\n<MATHSEG_0001>-isomorphism<MATHSEG_0002>\nsee\nCategories, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nMore precisely, any <MATH_0004>-morphism <MATH_0005>\ngives rise to a morphism <MATH_0006>. Conversely, given a morphism\nof sheaves <MATH_0007> over <MATH_0008> there exists a <MATH_0009>-morphism\n<MATH_0010> which gives rise to <MATH_0011>\nand which is unique up to unique <MATH_0012>-isomorphism.\n\n\n\n",
